# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:109
translate schinese gradient_test_7a85f975:

    # "Here is a full-screen angle gradient. It can be used for transitions."
    "这是一个全屏角度渐变，可以用来制作转场。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:111
translate schinese gradient_test_08c88aec:

    # "You can change many aspects of gradients by adjusting the arguments passed to them."
    "调整传入的参数，就能改变渐变效果的许多方面。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:114
translate schinese gradient_test_9cfc3acf:

    # "The gradient on the left is a standard linear gradient with three colours."
    "左侧是带有三种颜色的标准线性渐变。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:117
translate schinese gradient_test_e655534b:

    # "The gradient on the right has custom thresholds, so the colours start and end at different points."
    "右侧的渐变设置了自定义阈值，因此颜色会在不同位置开始和结束。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:120
translate schinese gradient_test_1791f204:

    # "Now the gradient on the right has been scaled down to half its size."
    "现在，右侧的渐变已经缩小到原来的一半。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:123
translate schinese gradient_test_f07861b6:

    # "Linear gradients can also be mirrored, like on the right. This is useful for creating symmetrical gradients."
    "线性渐变也可以像右侧那样镜像。这对制作对称渐变很有用。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:126
translate schinese gradient_test_6849999b:

    # "The gradient on the right's angle has been changed to 45 degrees."
    "右侧渐变的角度已经改成了 45 度。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:129
translate schinese gradient_test_35aef819:

    # "You can also adjust the center of the gradient as well."
    "你也可以调整渐变的中心。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:136
translate schinese gradient_test_8d58ad13:

    # "Here are two radial gradients. The one on the left is circular, and the one on the right is elliptical."
    "这里是两种径向渐变。左侧是圆形，右侧是椭圆形。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:137
translate schinese gradient_test_534f0b53:

    # "An elliptical gradient will stretch based on the dimensions of the image, while a circular one will always be a circle."
    "椭圆渐变会根据图像尺寸拉伸，而圆形渐变始终保持为圆形。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:140
translate schinese gradient_test_1fe82b0d:

    # "But when the gradient is a square, they will look very similar."
    "不过，当图像是正方形时，两者看起来会非常相似。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:142
translate schinese gradient_test_5d6236b7:

    # "Especially if you increase the scale of the circular gradient. However, the circular gradient uses smoothstepping to blend the gradient while the elliptical one does not."
    "尤其是当你增大圆形渐变的缩放比例时。不过，圆形渐变使用平滑步进来混合渐变，而椭圆形不是这样。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:145
translate schinese gradient_test_61580806:

    # "Remember also that you can provide transparent or semi-transparent colours to the gradients."
    "还要记得，你可以为渐变提供透明或半透明的颜色。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:148
translate schinese gradient_test_89363f0d:

    # "You can adjust the center of the radial gradients also."
    "你也可以调整径向渐变的中心。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:152
translate schinese gradient_test_3d9d5f77:

    # "Finally we'll look more closely at the angle gradient."
    "最后，我们再仔细看看角度渐变。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:154
translate schinese gradient_test_15bc3bac:

    # "You can provide it with different angles to change where the gradient begins."
    "你可以为它设置不同的角度，以改变渐变开始的位置。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:156
translate schinese gradient_test_7cf4601a:

    # "Remember you can use transparent colours for different effects as well."
    "记住，你也可以使用透明颜色来制作不同的效果。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:158
translate schinese gradient_test_4876b3ed:

    # "You can also provide the same colour for the start and end for a smoothly blended gradient all around."
    "你还可以让渐变的起点和终点使用相同颜色，从而得到四周平滑混合的渐变。"

# game/gradient_examples.rpyc:160
translate schinese gradient_test_6f4ca5cb:

    # "And that's all for this label. You'll be taken to a screen with some additional effects when you click next."
    "这个标签的内容就是这些。点击下一步后，你会看到一个带有其他效果的界面。"
